   <narrative xml:lang="EN">sex education for youth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">sex och samlevnad i Ukr</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet g&#xe4;ller f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av sexualupplysningen, till i synnerhet ungdomar, i Ukraina. Under detta projekt unders&#xf6;ks m&#xf6;jligheterna till ett mer omfattande samarbete mellan Ukraina och Sverige inom detta omr&#xe5;de.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists in improving the sexual education of especially youth in Ukraine. This project will examine the possibilities for a more extensive co-operation between Sweden and Ukraine in that field.</narrative>
  </description>
